    <bpmn:process id="W_W4834" name="W4834. License-Condition Compliance Monitoring (Insurance, Technical Capacity, CPD, Personnel)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous license-condition monitoring; condition shortfall alert; renewal (W4820)
Frequency: Continuous + monthly review
Volume: All license conditions across entities/categories
Owner: PCAB Compliance Lead / Compliance Portfolio (VS-166)
Participants: HR (VS-19.4 personnel), Finance (VS-26/VS-116 insurance), Engineering (VS-20 equipment), Legal
Source: workflow W4834 — License-Condition Compliance Monitoring (Insurance, Technical Capacity, CPD, Personnel)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4834_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4834_Lane1" name="PCAB Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4834_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4834_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4834_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4834_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4834_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4834_Start3" name="Continuous license-condition monitoring; condition shortfall alert; renewal (W4820)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4834_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4834_Task4" name="Maintain the license-condition matrix per license: required insurance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the license-condition matrix per license: required insurance (comprehensive liability, contractor&#x27;s all-risk, surety facility VS-116), technical-personnel complement (named PRC engineers/architects W4835), equipment capacity, capitalization, and continuing-education (CPD) units; map each to evidence in the audit trail (W4823)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Compliance Portfolio
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4834_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4834_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4834_Task5" name="Monitor conditions continuously: insurance currency (links to W4735 COI renewal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Monitor conditions continuously: insurance currency (links to W4735 COI renewal tracking), personnel retention (resignation → shortfall alert), equipment availability, and CPD-unit accumulation; raise shortfall alerts with cure-period tracking
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / HR / Finance / Engineering
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4834_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4834_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4834_Task6" name="On shortfall, cure within the PCAB cure period (replace personnel W4835…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: On shortfall, cure within the PCAB cure period (replace personnel W4835, restore insurance/equipment, complete CPD), document the cure, and escalate to lapse/breach handling (W4824) if uncured; report condition-health to governance (W4840)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / HR / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per shortfall</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4834_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4834_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4834_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4834_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4834_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-727 (ensure controlled execution — Contractor Compliance, Inspection Response &amp; Analytics (PA-165.3).) | - CTL-727: license conditions monitored continuously; shortfalls cured within cure period; condition-health reported
Owner: PCAB Compliance Lead / Compliance Portfolio (VS-166)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4834_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4834_Annotation8" targetRef="W4834_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4834_Flow10" sourceRef="W4834_Start3" targetRef="W4834_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4834_Flow11" sourceRef="W4834_Task4" targetRef="W4834_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4834_Flow12" sourceRef="W4834_Task5" targetRef="W4834_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4834_Flow13" sourceRef="W4834_Task6" targetRef="W4834_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
