    <bpmn:process id="W_W4836" name="W4836. Unlicensed-Contracting Risk Control — In-Scope/Out-of-Scope Boundary &amp; Material-Supply-vs-Install Decision" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New service/offering; bid scope ambiguity; sales-contract drafting; compliance review
Frequency: Per offering/bid/contract + periodic policy refresh
Volume: All in-scope-vs-out-of-scope decisions
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / PCAB Compliance Lead
Participants: Trade Sales (VS-11), Installation (VS-12), Design (VS-66), Procurement (VS-03), Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4836 — Unlicensed-Contracting Risk Control — In-Scope/Out-of-Scope Boundary &amp; Material-Supply-vs-Install Decision</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4836_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4836_Lane1" name="PCAB Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4836_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4836_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4836_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4836_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4836_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4836_Start3" name="New service/offering; bid scope ambiguity; sales-contract drafting; compliance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4836_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4836_Task4" name="Maintain the in-scope/out-of-scope (contracting vs material-supply) decision…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the in-scope/out-of-scope (contracting vs material-supply) decision framework: what work is &quot;contracting&quot; requiring a PCAB license (execution of construction/install scope, design-build, delivery-and-install on B2G) vs pure material supply (sale of goods without installation scope); codify the boundary in policy and sales guidance
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4836_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4836_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4836_Task5" name="Apply at bid/contract drafting: review each bid (VS-46/VS-11) and customer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Apply at bid/contract drafting: review each bid (VS-46/VS-11) and customer contract (VS-100.3) for scope that would cross into contracting (incidental install, &quot;free&quot; setup, design services, B2G delivery-and-install); require license confirmation (W4828) or restructure to stay out of scope; train sales on the boundary
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal / Trade Sales / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per bid/contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4836_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4836_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4836_Task6" name="Audit compliance with the boundary: review actual performed work vs contracted…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Audit compliance with the boundary: review actual performed work vs contracted scope to detect quiet scope-creep into unlicensed contracting; manage exceptions; feed boundary-disputes to regulatory liaison (W4821) and findings to analytics (W4839)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Internal Audit (VS-21) / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4836_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4836_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4836_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4836_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4836_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-727 (ensure controlled execution — Contractor Compliance, Inspection Response &amp; Analytics (PA-165.3).) | - CTL-727: contracting-scope contracts require license confirmation; sales trained; boundary audited periodically
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / PCAB Compliance Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4836_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4836_Annotation8" targetRef="W4836_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
