    <bpmn:process id="W_W4838" name="W4838. Penalty/Violation Management, Administrative Proceedings &amp; Reinstatement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: PCAB notice of violation (show-cause, fine, suspension, revocation); inspection finding (W4833); complaint
Frequency: Ad hoc
Volume: ~rare violation events
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Legal (VS-100.3) / PCAB Compliance Lead
Participants: COO, Trade Sales (VS-11), Finance (penalty), External counsel, CIAP/PCAB
Source: workflow W4838 — Penalty/Violation Management, Administrative Proceedings &amp; Reinstatement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4838_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4838_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4838_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4838_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4838_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4838_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4838_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4838_Start3" name="PCAB notice of violation (show-cause, fine, suspension, revocation); inspection finding…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4838_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4838_Task4" name="Receive the violation notice, assess the alleged offense (unlicensed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Receive the violation notice, assess the alleged offense (unlicensed contracting Sec. 6/8, condition breach, project-registration failure, safety W4827), assess exposure (fine, suspension, revocation, bid-ban, contract-invalidity), and assemble the defense/response with evidence (W4823) and external counsel
Responsible (R): Legal / PCAB Compliance Lead
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / COO
Duration: Per event (immediate)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4838_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4838_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4838_Task5" name="Manage the administrative proceeding: file the response/appeal within PCAB/CIAP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage the administrative proceeding: file the response/appeal within PCAB/CIAP deadlines, negotiate settlement/penalty mitigation, manage continuity of active projects (pause/subcontract/transfer W4829), and escalate appeals to the Office of the President/courts (VS-100) if needed
Responsible (R): Legal / PCAB Compliance Lead / External Counsel / Trade Sales
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / COO
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4838_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4838_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4838_Task6" name="On resolution (penalty paid, suspension served, reinstatement obtained), update…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: On resolution (penalty paid, suspension served, reinstatement obtained), update the register (VS-166), record in the legal matter (VS-100.3) and audit trail (W4823), conduct root-cause review, strengthen controls (W4824), and report to governance (W4840) and analytics (W4839)
Responsible (R): Legal / PCAB Compliance Lead / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4838_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4838_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4838_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4838_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4838_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-727 (ensure controlled execution — Contractor Compliance, Inspection Response &amp; Analytics (PA-165.3).) | - CTL-727: violation response within deadline; continuity plan for active projects; root-cause review documented
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Legal (VS-100.3) / PCAB Compliance Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
