    <bpmn:process id="W_W4839" name="W4839. Contractor Compliance Analytics — Bid Win-Rate, Project Margin, Penalty/Reputation, License Economics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; board reporting (W4840); strategy review (W4817)
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly + annual
Volume: Group-wide contractor-compliance analytics
Owner: PCAB Compliance Lead / Analytics (VS-28) / Finance (VS-17.4)
Participants: Trade Sales (VS-11), Government Sales (VS-46), Strategy (VS-33), Treasury-Surety (VS-116)
Source: workflow W4839 — Contractor Compliance Analytics — Bid Win-Rate, Project Margin, Penalty/Reputation, License Economics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4839_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4839_Lane1" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4839_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4839_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4839_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4839_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4839_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4839_Start3" name="Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; board reporting (W4840); strategy review (W4817)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4839_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4839_Task4" name="Build the contractor-compliance analytics suite: license-coverage %…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build the contractor-compliance analytics suite: license-coverage %, renewal-on-time %, project-registration timeliness, bid win-rate by license category, project margin for licensed work, bond/encumbrance utilization (VS-116), penalty/violation rate, inspection findings, and license economics (application/renewal/bond cost vs bid-access revenue)
Responsible (R): Analytics / PCAB Compliance Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4839_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4839_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4839_Task5" name="Analyze &amp; report: license-cost-vs-revenue ROI, category-upgrade payback…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Analyze &amp; report: license-cost-vs-revenue ROI, category-upgrade payback, subcontractor-utilization, scope-creep incidents (W4836), and the unlicensed-work-incident trend; benchmark against industry; identify improvement opportunities
Responsible (R): Analytics / PCAB Compliance Lead / Strategy
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4839_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4839_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4839_Task6" name="Feed insights to strategy (W4817 — category/coverage decisions), governance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Feed insights to strategy (W4817 — category/coverage decisions), governance (W4840 — board reporting), and continuous improvement (W4840); track action closure
Responsible (R): Analytics / PCAB Compliance Lead
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4839_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4839_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
