    <bpmn:process id="W_W4840" name="W4840. PCAB Compliance Governance, Board Reporting &amp; Program Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Board/audit-risk-committee cycle (VS-36); annual program review; incident (W4824/W4838); regulator change (W4821)
Frequency: Quarterly board reporting + annual program review
Volume: 1 program governance
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / PCAB Compliance Lead
Participants: Internal Audit (VS-21), Risk (VS-21.2), CFO, COO, Board/Audit &amp; Risk Committee
Source: workflow W4840 — PCAB Compliance Governance, Board Reporting &amp; Program Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4840_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4840_Lane1" name="PCAB Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4840_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4840_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4840_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4840_Lane2" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4840_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4840_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4840_Start4" name="Board/audit-risk-committee cycle (VS-36); annual program review; incident (W4824/W4838)…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4840_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4840_Task5" name="Govern the PCAB compliance program: policy, the in-scope/out-of-scope framework…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govern the PCAB compliance program: policy, the in-scope/out-of-scope framework (W4836), roles/RACI, the compliance calendar (W4820/W4834), risk register entries (links to VS-21.2), and the program&#x27;s place in the compliance portfolio (VS-166)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal / Risk
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4840_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4840_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4840_Task6" name="Report to the board/audit &amp; risk committee (VS-36.1): license status, coverage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Report to the board/audit &amp; risk committee (VS-36.1): license status, coverage, renewal/condition health, project-registration compliance, inspection/penalty events (W4833/W4838), analytics (W4839), and emerging regulatory risk (W4821); ensure officer-personal-liability exposure (RA 4566 Sec. 8) is disclosed
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / PCAB Compliance Lead
Accountable (A): CEO / Board Audit &amp; Risk Committee
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4840_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4840_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4840_Task7" name="Drive continuous improvement: maturity assessment, benchmarking…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Drive continuous improvement: maturity assessment, benchmarking, control-strengthening from incidents (W4824/W4838), regulatory-change adoption (W4821), and process improvement (VS-133); report program maturity to governance
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Internal Audit / VP Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4840_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4840_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4840_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4840_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
