        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-727 (ensure controlled execution — Contractor Compliance, Inspection Response &amp; Analytics (PA-165.3).) | - CTL-727: quarterly board reporting; officer-liability disclosed; program maturity assessed annually
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / PCAB Compliance Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
